{"review_id": "7cf97d5d-e1eb-4dee-adbf-c24261c2ef72", "package": "com.oristats.habitbull", "app_name": "Habit Tracker", "language": "sv", "language_name": "Swedish", "rating": 5, "text": "Har testat flera liknande appar, och detta är den bästa hittills. Den har hjälpt mig skapa en permanent vana att använda tandtråd varje dag.", "author": "En av Googles användare", "date": "2015-03-26T09:12:37Z", "thumbs_up": 0, "app_version": "1.2.9", "developer_reply": null}
{"review_id": "e0e8864b-53ba-41bf-af4b-43a650a0b77c", "package": "com.oristats.habitbull", "app_name": "Habit Tracker", "language": "sv", "language_name": "Swedish", "rating": 2, "text": "The streaks don't work, have shown I'm in a streak for \"being creative at least once a week\" the last two months without me marking any day as green :-(", "author": "En av Googles användare", "date": "2015-03-25T03:58:09Z", "thumbs_up": 0, "app_version": "1.2.9", "developer_reply": "Hi Maja, please see my email about this. It's supposed to be this way because blank days means we don't know whether you were successful for that day or not - so the streak might still continue that's why we keep showing it. If you mark a day as unsuccessful (by tapping it twice), you will see the streak break."}
